450
00:34:51.933 --> 00:34:53.725
- December 13th, 1923.

451
00:34:55.683 --> 00:34:57.267
- Seriously?

452
00:34:57.267 --> 00:34:59.225
- What you calling me a liar?

453
00:34:59.225 --> 00:35:00.933
- Same birthday as me.

454
00:35:00.933 --> 00:35:03.808
